<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on MFF - Future.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on MFF - Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets GmbH, Frankfurt has issued four million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on MFF-Futures, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.DEC.96-28.AUG.97   PAYDATE     02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     SPOT REF    111.48 PCT</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE	  ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	110 PCT	 4.65 DEM</p>
<p> PUT	 110 PCT	 2.94 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	114 PCT	 2.41 DEM</p>
<p> PUT	 106 PCT	 1.48 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
